Hi all,

I am fitting a space-time model in INLA with an SPDE and have available data at a finer temporal resolution for one of my covariates (data is measured every 12 days in a region and this covariate is measured every day in the same region). I would like to know if I can include this finer covariate data in some (functional?) way?

Many thanks,
Erin

